 pawn and cost you a piece, and his king has walked out of the corner to safety. }) (37... Qe3 { A quiet queen move with a mate sitting right there on the board. He gets a free move to rescue his king. } 38. Qc6+ Kd8 39. a3 Qe5 { His king has walked out of the corner into open space and nothing you have can catch it. The game is level again. }) 0-1


